{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14213530","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14213530","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1421353001:1":{"text":"あたいに何の用？帝国に心酔してたあたいを笑いにでも来たの？","source_cn":"所以，你们找我有何贵干？想继续辱骂我曾经的信仰吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACF473463104A170","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1421353001":{"text":"あたいに何の用？帝国に心酔してたあたいを笑いにでも来たの？","source_cn":"所以，你们找我有何贵干？想继续辱骂我曾经的信仰吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACF473463104A170","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421353002:1":{"text":"へえ、どうせまた過去の罪とかでしょう？いいわよ、何だって見てやるわよ。","source_cn":"好啊，又是什么无聊的罪恶的东西？我看就是了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02571FF05FBCDBC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421353004:1":{"text":"……アンタなら読めるだろ？自分で見てみな。","source_cn":"……你应该也能看懂这份文件的开头，你自己读吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2891B962455EEB2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421353005:1":{"text":"読めばいいんでしょ、読めば。\nヘクト及び……オルディン工房、某年、第8ロット、14番ライン鍛造……","source_cn":"读就读。\\n赫托及……深岩工坊，某年第8批第14号线锻造……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA7A7C719C74A3D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421353006:1":{"text":"高純度オルデナイトを用いた主力戦闘用ロングボウEP04……な、なんなのこれ！？","source_cn":"全精深岩晶制造主战长弓EP04……这，这写的什么东西？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F8E66A3C61F685B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421353007:1":{"text":"ここを見ろ。一番下の手書きの文字だ。","source_cn":"来，看这里，最下面的手写。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2086C73C8415380","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421353008:1":{"text":"バージョン番号は公開不可なため、コードネーム――<style=\"highlight\">ドゥアガル</style>で代用！？","source_cn":"版本号起名无法对外，临时赋用代号——<style=hi...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD66594B326539DCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421353009:1":{"text":"信じられないという顔でイーナがゾーヤを見つめる。ゾーヤは落ち着いた表情で書類を開いた。","source_cn":"伊娜难以置信地抬头看向祖娅，而祖娅平静地再次翻开了这份文件。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x947D7C7CBFDE3DC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421353010:1":{"text":"これはなんなのかって聞いたけど、アンタもヘラも、この文字列の意味はよく知ってるだろ？","source_cn":"刚刚你问的这写的什么东西……你和海拉主管，都应该很熟悉才是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA9AE6493A708369","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421353011:1":{"text":"この武器のメイン設計者と責任者は、偉大なる神、ヘクト様だった。","source_cn":"赫托，伟大的神明，是这份武器的主设计师和主负责人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x905ABD5E40ECA096","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1421353012:1":{"text":"オルディン工房は、この武器を製造する工場と生産ラインの名前であり、ヘクト様が生産を管理していた主要施設。","source_cn":"深岩工坊，是它主要出产的工厂和生产线名称，也是赫托主管...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA35986967DCBACCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421353013:1":{"text":"年代は置いといて、第8ロット、14番ラインは、その年の第14番目の生産ラインで製造された8ロット目の製品……","source_cn":"年份就不提了，第8批第14号线，代表本年度批次下的第1...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AFF3925AE90A0D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1421353014:1":{"text":"そしてEP04は、改良を重ねた四代目の試作品って意味だな。","source_cn":"而EP04，则代表着是迭代后的第四版本。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06C9EF562F44470B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1421353015:1":{"text":"武器を改良するとき、通常は試作品の中から一番代表的なものを選び、それをベースに手を加えていく……","source_cn":"在迭代武器的时候，会从版本中优中选优选出最有代表性的一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07931FB58F646BEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1421353016:1":{"text":"つまり、ドゥアガルは……数ある試作品ロットの中から、次の改良用に選ばれた一つの見本品にすぎないってこと？","source_cn":"所以，杜恩加尔，只是诸多批次版本中择选出下次迭代的模板？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C157E70209165AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1421353017:1":{"text":"そういうことだ。そして、この命名法が意味することは……","source_cn":"正是。这个命名方式能够证明的是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A7CA7F128D35E15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1421353018:1":{"text":"イーナ、アンタが憧れていた帝国は、伝統や民族情緒溢れる、古き時代の国じゃない。","source_cn":"伊娜，你所向往的钢心帝国，并不是充斥着传统与诗歌的古老国度。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09A5DC31300B103C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1421353019:1":{"text":"帝国が滅びる少し前から、一人何役もこなせるような技師は、徐々に少なくなっていたんだ。","source_cn":"甚至在帝国覆灭前夕，无所不精的多面手工程师也在慢慢退出舞台。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0F22E15DF21081E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1421353020:1":{"text":"神が降臨し、帝国が存続していたあの時代から、ドワーフたちは分業や専門分け、効率化に加えて、工場化への取り組みを始めていた。","source_cn":"在神明临世，帝国长存的古老年代，矮人们就已经开始尝试分...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x601CCBF527937902","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1421353021:1":{"text":"そして神器の大量生産を――機械技術で神の力と魔力を御する、ドワーフ自身の道を模索していたんだ。","source_cn":"并且探索着，能够批量生产所谓神器，连神力与魔力都为机械...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E6E8692C407ED2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1421353022:1":{"text":"それと、あたしたちが今やっている工場や生産ラインと何の違いが……？","source_cn":"这，这和我们现在的工厂和生产线有什么区别？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B074F92B98D214E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1421353023:1":{"text":"同じだよ。でも、同じだからこそ……！","source_cn":"……没有区别。正是因为没有区别！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DE8197233DDF2CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1421353024:1":{"text":"オレたちは、一度途絶えた道を再び……いや、たぶん<style=\"highlight\">一度も途絶えたことがない道</style>を、ずっと歩んでいたんだ。","source_cn":"所以，我们其实一直走在曾经一度断绝……不，或许<sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB81A3D3E4C48D45F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1421353025:1":{"text":"神の裏切り、帝国の滅亡……犯した罪はいずれ時間と共に消えていく。","source_cn":"神明背叛了我们，帝国覆灭……罪孽终究会被时光冲刷。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB383BDDBCB5C21BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female"