","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1421353031:1":{"text":"ここの導線って、魔力付与されてるよね？だから普通の機械式よりも速くて、正確で、高い威力を発揮できるはず。","source_cn":"我没看错的话，这里的引线使用了魔力注入，从而能产生比一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F32F4D789C93FDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1421353032:1":{"text":"でも、ならどうしてここにもう一つ同じ構造を付け加えなかったの？","source_cn":"但要是这样，为什么不在这一部分再增加同样的结构呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62C7FD4F1F6BCB56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1421353033:1":{"text":"それは、あの時はまだ、オレの要望通りに魔力を付与してくれるメイジが見つかるか、確信がなかったからさ。","source_cn":"因为在设计之初，我还不确定能不能找到按照我的标准愿意为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6943D6A3C2211D40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1421353034:1":{"text":"よく観察すれば、導線の作用条件がものすごく厳しいことが分かるはずだ。極めて繊細で精密な魔力操作ができるメイジじゃないと無理なんだよ。","source_cn":"如果你足够仔细，就会发现，魔力引线的触发条件非常严苛，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D8EEC68DECB0477","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1421353035:1":{"text":"けど、やっぱオレの見立て通り、アンタは鋭い勘と大胆な発想を持ってるな。","source_cn":"但，我果然没有看错，你有着足够敏锐的触觉和大胆的思路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C02088676184519","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":""